        "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nThe TrueNAS integration (System Resources, Disk Health, and related widgets) fails silently with no data displayed. The \"Test connection and save\" button reports success, but all widgets show \"no integration data available.\"\n\nHomarr logs reveal a ZodError indicating the TrueNAS-13.0 reporting API returns a response that no longer matches the expected schema. Two distinct failures:\n\nThe identifier field returns a value not in Homarr's allowed set of \"cpu\" | \"memory\" | \"cputemp\"\nThe aggregations.min, aggregations.mean, and aggregations.max fields are returned as arrays, but Homarr expects records (objects)\n\n\nFull error from logs:\n```Integration query failed integrationKind=\"truenas\"\ncaused by: Failed to parse integration data integrationName=\"TrueNAS\"\ncaused by ZodError: [\n  {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_value\",\n    \"values\": [\"cpu\", \"memory\", \"cputemp\"],\n    \"path\": [0, \"identifier\"],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid option: expected one of \\\"cpu\\\"|\\\"memory\\\"|\\\"cputemp\\\"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"expected\": \"record\",\n    \"code\": \"invalid_type\",\n    \"path\": [0, \"aggregations\", \"min\"],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid input: expected record, received array\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"expected\": \"record\",\n    \"code\": \"invalid_type\",\n    \"path\": [0, \"aggregations\", \"mean\"],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid input: expected record, received array\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"expected\": \"record\",\n    \"code\": \"invalid_type\",\n    \"path\": [0, \"aggregations\", \"max\"],\n    \"message\": \"Invalid input: expected record, received array\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun TrueNAS-13.0-U6.8\nAdd a TrueNAS integration in Homarr with the correct URL and API key\nAdd System Resources / Disk Health widgets linked to the integration\nObserve that all widgets show no data despite a successful connection test\n\n### Impact\n\nAll TrueNAS data widgets are non-functional on TrueNAS TrueNAS-13.0-U6.8  - No workaround available.\n\n\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version\n\n1.69.2\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nChrome",
